OS: Microsoft Windows 11 Home Single Language (NT 10.0.26200.0)
Node: v24.21.0
npm: 11.19.0
Code SHA (HEAD at test time): 56502b4
Base SHA (merge-base with origin/main): dedd8c4e5d4b9ab741d0db86045b03df3b729ca2

Scope of change
---------------
- financeEventsConsumer.ts now binds all 8 registered finance event types:
  6 legacy (payment.succeeded, payment.failed, payment.refunded,
  funding.topup_succeeded, utility.paid, utility.failed/refunded as already
  registered) plus funding.cashout_completed and funding.cashout_failed.
- New cashout mapping: funding.cashout_completed -> CASHOUT_SUCCEEDED with a
  vi-VN formatted BigInt amount; funding.cashout_failed -> CASHOUT_FAILED and
  never copies the upstream reason into the notification message.
- Mapping TypeError failures are wrapped as NonRetryableError(
  'INVALID_EVENT_PAYLOAD') so a permanently malformed payload is not retried.
- EVENTS.md binding table updated; docs/evidence/N19/inventory.md added.

